{"id":"16faa2dd23a728d88c611735","source":"meduza-rss","source_name":"Meduza","platform":"rss","url":"https://meduza.io/en/feature/2026/08/15/inside-russia-s-new-gulag-what-the-new-yorker-found-in-a-rostov-cell-of-ukrainian-women","published_at":"2026-08-15T00:19:31Z","collected_at":"2026-08-15T01:46:22.706350Z","title":"Inside Russia’s new gulag: what The New Yorker found in a Rostov cell of Ukrainian women","text":"stories Inside Russia’s new gulag: what The New Yorker found in a Rostov cell of Ukrainian women August 15, 2026, 12:19 am Source: The New Yorker A portrait of Ukrainian Valentina Zayarnaya, who is being held in Rostov pretrial detention center No. 1, drawn by one of her fellow inmates Mediazona Since 2014 — and especially since 2022 — Russia has seized and still holds at least 1,878 Ukrainian civilians. These are only the confirmed cases; the real number is likely far higher. At least 223 of them are women. Like Ukrainian prisoners of war, many civilian hostages from Ukraine have been tortured and are held in inhumane conditions. But unlike military prisoners, they have little hope of going free in an exchange. Ukraine, citing the Geneva Conventions, insists they should never have been detained at all. Russia points to rulings from its own courts and says they are serving sentences for terrorism, treason, and other serious crimes. The two sides do not trade military prisoners for civilians, which leaves the return of these detainees unresolved. The New Yorker has published a long piece about Ukrainian women who ended up sharing a cell at Rostov pretrial detention center No. 1. For","html":"","media":[],"author":"","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"6e6b6f124e85b420e1c673e7b62eb4258ce9c6cc3a6fbae7bd41caa6b5af3c69","original_text_chars":7980,"original_html_chars":26013,"text_truncated":true,"media_count":1,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://meduza.io/en/feature/2026/08/15/inside-russia-s-new-gulag-what-the-new-yorker-found-in-a-rostov-cell-of-ukrainian-women","entry_link":"https://meduza.io/en/feature/2026/08/15/inside-russia-s-new-gulag-what-the-new-yorker-found-in-a-rostov-cell-of-ukrainian-women"}}}
{"id":"052e351c54bd6647406734d7","source":"ru-zvezda-tg","source_name":"Zvezda News","platform":"telegram","url":"https://t.me/zvezdanews/179439","published_at":"2026-08-15T01:24:16Z","collected_at":"2026-08-15T01:46:27.967378Z","title":"","text":"🇺🇸 Трамп собрался присвоить Ормузский пролив США. Американский президент заявил, что объявит стратегический водный путь американской территорией после завершения конфликта с Ираном. \"После того, как мы закончим разгром Ирана, который терпит очень сокрушительное поражение, довольно скоро я объявлю Ормузский пролив территорией Соединенных Штатов\", — сказал Трамп. По его словам, Вашингтон уже контролирует проход судов через пролив и продолжает блокаду иранских портов. При этом большая часть стран мира считает Ормузский пролив зоной международного судоходства в соответствии с нормами международного морского права. ⭐️ Подписаться на Zvezdanews 📬 Zvezdanews в MAX","html":"","media":["https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/rOBSbSVKOqBg3lOuEyjqgI7MTR640Bg-bYM7us0ziEXgqwEZ6s3u_6B3hTKRqaRr8TDK4aF1wqsPhn2_fHsdfi3A3OowwRnwtXWVTvY8YLS_a8EmkJPZYx86PC7iAVa_wHyK5AGY3QYSPvAl3XrWCzeaPCu9KsjDG6UXWeHhFllCnpYofWok5g8uf-ixGzgsbuWoT1B4NECUqhvF9RQA4YppIlr8RNEFUTmSo35j9P9PWRz3LG-Jzrz29Wod6ZavogkoHZhp5Ia0yi1w-odRAZqm23yuG0oT9KOBs-DNuxu-S0i9afIOhFOLjFyuGKWVcKZAWRDErsHV6Y2uHhss1A.jpg"],"author":"Zvezda News","language":"und","group":"official-ru","perspective":"russian","trust":"primary","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"5b7726c0bf41f1ddfb508a01d79ab8c6839de4ce18d5e2188562d9e5071c246e","original_text_chars":665,"original_html_chars":6757,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":9,"platform":{"post":"zvezdanews/179439"}}}
{"id":"ae310c349ef7e89bdfcdcb4b","source":"ru-ria-tg","source_name":"RIA Novosti","platform":"telegram","url":"https://t.me/rian_ru/344144","published_at":"2026-08-15T00:07:17Z","collected_at":"2026-08-15T01:46:25.442075Z","title":"","text":"Минпросвещения определило перечень школьных предметов на учебный год. В этом году для пятых классов добавлен новый учебный предмет – «Духовно-нравственная культура России». Родной язык, родная литература и второй иностранный язык включаются в учебный план старшей школы по заявлению родителей и при наличии условий в школе. Полный список предметов – в нашем материале . 🔹 Подписаться на РИА Новости","html":"","media":["https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/FeqwFl3Ernm67I7qIRVU5Ns-aSEROkVR7WHnGm6RNQQ2gZAypy8-GbUyLahVGKfvmZJLTbcKeHd5D_TAm9SJ5SF6n8wIiT6leDnSOp1SRy0BoiS1IKEpHEBrYTrgPVzj5D4qHPyRy-BhMLK3J6LumY3S7lFK03XGPaFaC5lWjfPPMoeqw2_iON0ZaxBV-tOm3Z1roW9qjxyOugPnwoIkqAl3TfUvuAejPDQg12XiHH6hCA2OsThuGTghytjaxz6DX4jsV39TvunleofwdUWai4iLgslkeQTH3hYotdGKnkJILUtCkZlbfps04bwxHlD8hn4yp9Mp-iCILpwebRb4Qg.jpg"],"author":"RIA Novosti","language":"und","group":"official-ru","perspective":"russian","trust":"primary","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"01f9901cea6591ab54e4237181f0709506b2f315e7704d407bc5669e733e837f","original_text_chars":398,"original_html_chars":5735,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":4,"platform":{"post":"rian_ru/344144"}}}
