{"id":"0d4f3faff576d53ffea53c36","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/15/fears-for-missing-sydney-teen-who-hasnt-been-seen-since-leaving-for-hike-on-wednesday","published_at":"2026-08-15T01:07:41Z","collected_at":"2026-08-15T01:46:58.872715Z","title":"Fears for missing Sydney teen who hasn’t been seen since leaving for hike on Wednesday","text":"Lily Hooper left her home in Sydney’s south-west about 8am on 12 August, after telling family she was going for a hike in the Nattai national park. Photograph: NSW Police View image in fullscreen Lily Hooper left her home in Sydney’s south-west about 8am on 12 August, after telling family she was going for a hike in the Nattai national park. Photograph: NSW Police New South Wales Fears for missing Sydney teen who hasn’t been seen since leaving for hike on Wednesday Fresh search teams to scour Nattai national park for Lily Hooper, 18, who failed to return home from a bushwalk Get our breaking news email , free app or daily news podcast Lisa Cox and AAP Fri 14 Aug 2026 21.07 EDT Last modified on Fri 14 Aug 2026 21.18 EDT Share Prefer the Guardian on Google The search for an 18-year-old bushwalker missing in the Southern Highlands of New South Wales since Wednesday is continuing, with fresh teams arriving at the Nattai national park on Saturday morning. Lily Hooper left her home in Sydney’s south-west about 8am on 12 August, after telling family she was going for a hike in the national park, north-west of Mittagong. The experienced hiker was reported missing when she did not return th","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/88767de4bf103f7cd1db7a710fb56defa740aef5/0_0_1638_1311/master/1638.jpg?width=465&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none","https://media.guim.co.uk/10b4e02333ee97ecf51d5e814fd324a88832fb17/1177_0_2998_3000/2998.jpg"],"author":"Lisa Cox and AAP","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","tru